### PackageHistory API Tests
### This file contains HTTP requests for testing the PackageHistory API endpoints

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@authToken = {{auth.response.body.token}}

### Authentication (if needed)
# @name auth
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
# Content-Type: application/json
# 
# {
#   "email": "admin@example.com",
#   "password": "Admin123!"
# }

### Get All Package Histories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get All Package Histories with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory?page=1&pageSize=10&accountId=1&packageId=1&isExpired=false
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Package History by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Create New Package History
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiredDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "remainingTickets": 10,
  "remainingMessages": 20,
  "packageId": 1,
  "accountId": 1
}

### Update Package History
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiredDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "remainingTickets": 8,
  "remainingMessages": 18,
  "packageId": 1,
  "accountId": 1
}

### Delete Package History
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Remaining Tickets
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1/remaining-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

5

### Update Remaining Messages
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1/remaining-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

15

### Extend Package Expiration
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1/extend-expiration
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

"2025-01-31T23:59:59Z"

### Get Package Histories by Account ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/account/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Package Histories by Package ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/package/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Active Package Histories for Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/account/1/active
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Expired Package Histories for Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/account/1/expired
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Check if User Has Active Package
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/check-active?accountId=1&packageId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Package Histories by Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/date-range?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Expiring Packages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/expiring?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Package History Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get User Package Usage Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/account/1/usage-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Error Cases

### Get Non-existent Package History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Non-existent Package History
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiredDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "remainingTickets": 10,
  "remainingMessages": 20,
  "packageId": 1,
  "accountId": 1
}

### Delete Non-existent Package History
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Remaining Tickets of Non-existent Package History
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/999/remaining-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

5

### Update Remaining Messages of Non-existent Package History
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/999/remaining-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

15

### Extend Expiration of Non-existent Package History
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/999/extend-expiration
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

"2025-01-31T23:59:59Z"

### Invalid Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/date-range?startDate=2024-12-31&endDate=2024-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Invalid Days Parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/expiring?days=0
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Negative Remaining Tickets
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1/remaining-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

-5

### Negative Remaining Messages
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1/remaining-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

-10

### Past Expiration Date
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1/extend-expiration
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z"

### Create Package History with Invalid Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiredDate": "2023-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "remainingTickets": -5,
  "remainingMessages": -10,
  "packageId": -1,
  "accountId": -1
}

### Test Different Package History Scenarios

### Create Premium Package History
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiredDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "remainingTickets": 50,
  "remainingMessages": 100,
  "packageId": 2,
  "accountId": 1
}

### Create Basic Package History
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiredDate": "2024-06-30T23:59:59Z",
  "remainingTickets": 10,
  "remainingMessages": 20,
  "packageId": 1,
  "accountId": 2
}

### Create Expired Package History
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiredDate": "2023-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "remainingTickets": 5,
  "remainingMessages": 10,
  "packageId": 1,
  "accountId": 3
}

### Test Package Usage Scenarios

### Use Tickets (Update Remaining)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1/remaining-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

8

### Use Messages (Update Remaining)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1/remaining-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

18

### Extend Package for Another Month
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/1/extend-expiration
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

"2025-01-31T23:59:59Z"

### Test Statistics and Reports

### Get Statistics for Current Month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get User Usage Summary for Active User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/account/1/usage-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Expiring Packages in Next 30 Days
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/expiring?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Package Histories for Last Quarter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packagehistory/date-range?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
